<view class="searchbar"><input value="{{q}}" bindinput="input" bindconfirm="search" placeholder="搜索标准、法规、工具"/><button bindtap="search">搜索</button></view><view class="container"><view class="section-title" wx:if="{{tools.length}}">匹配工具</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{tools}}" wx:key="name" data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="openTool"><view class="module-title">{{item.name}}</view></view><view class="section-title">资料结果（{{items.length}}）</view><standard-card wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" item="{{item}}"/><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!items.length&&!tools.length}}">没有找到匹配内容</view></view>